  "answer_text": "Here's a roundup of the **best laptop deals online right now** across different categories:\n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udfc6 Best Laptop Deals Online (May 2026)\n\n### \ud83d\udcbc Best Overall / Premium Laptop\n**Lenovo Yoga (14-inch OLED)**\nCPU: Intel Core Ultra 7 258V | RAM: 32GB LPDDR5x | Storage: 1TB PCIe 4.0 SSD | Screen: 14-inch, 2880\u00d71800 OLED \u2014 this Yoga is considered one of the best Windows laptops you can get right now. It weighs under three pounds and the battery can last up to 23 hours.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcb8 Top Discounted Laptops Right Now\n\n\nHere are some of the hottest deals currently available:\n\n- **Microsoft Surface Laptop** (Snapdragon X Elite / 15-inch 2496\u00d71664 / 16GB RAM / 1TB SSD) \u2014 **$1,699.99** ($500 off at Amazon)\n- **Dell Plus 16** (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V / 16-inch touchscreen / 16GB RAM / 1TB SSD) \u2014 **$930** ($269.99 off at Best Buy)\n- **HP OmniBook X Flip 16** (Intel Core Ultra 9 288V / 16-inch 2880\u00d71800 OLED / 32GB RAM / 2TB SSD) \u2014 **$1,074.99** ($524.01 off at Adorama)\n- **LG Gram 14** (Intel Core i5 / 14-inch / 16GB RAM / 256GB SSD) \u2014 **$1,149.99** ($199.01 off at Adorama)\n- **Dell 16 Plus** (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V / 16-inch 2560\u00d71600 / 16GB RAM / 1TB SSD) \u2014 **$899.99** ($530 off at Newegg)\n\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfae Best Gaming Laptop Deals\n\nSome of the top gaming laptop deals include:\n- **$1,000 off** an RTX 5070 OLED gaming laptop with Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX at Best Buy\n- **$1,100 off** an RTX 5080-powered HP Omen Max gaming laptop\n- **$1,150 off** a Dell RTX 5090 gaming laptop (now $4,399)\n- **Acer Predator Helios Neo 18 AI** (18-inch) dropped to **$1,799**\n- **$400 off** an Acer Predator OLED with RTX 5070 Ti and 32GB DDR5, now under $1,800\n- **$500 off** Lenovo's Legion 5i gaming laptop, now at **$1,599**\n\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udca1 Budget Gaming Options\n\nThere are also solid budget-friendly picks, such as:\n- A **14-inch laptop with Core Ultra 5 226V / 16GB / 512GB** for just **$649**\n- A **16-inch RTX 5060 gaming laptop (Ryzen 9 8940HX / 16GB / 512GB)** on sale for **$1,299** (was $1,999 \u2014 save $700)\n- A **14-inch RTX 5060 laptop (Core Ultra 7 255H / 16GB / 1TB)** for **$1,499** (was $2,599 \u2014 save $1,100)\n\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\uded2 Where to Shop\nThese deals are updated every weekday and cover home use laptops, gaming laptops, and Chromebooks across major retailers. Top stores to check include:\n- **Amazon**\n- **Best Buy**\n- **Newegg**\n- **Adorama**\n- **Dell.com**\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd0d Buying Tips\n- You'll want at least 8GB of RAM, though 16GB is preferable \u2014 especially for gaming. Avoid laptops with under 4GB of RAM or 128GB of SSD storage.\n- There are often big sales or events at major retailers, and using in-depth reviews, benchmarks, and historical price analysis can help you sort the good deals from the bad.\n\nHappy laptop hunting! \ud83c\udf89",
